| 4317 | OTLP gRPC | `allow all;` | `allow 10.99.0.0/27;` then `deny all;` |
| 4318 | OTLP HTTP | `allow all;` | `allow 10.99.0.0/27;` then `deny all;` |
| 14318 | Operator inject | `allow 172.20.0.1; deny all;` | **unchanged** |

